# p19 probe: is the block the part of the view the previous frame did not see?
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first usual two-step cut (position, then direction)
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_again same pose, frames later
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_dirfirst cut with direction first: the previous frame saw none of this view
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_dirfirst_again same pose, frames later
# p20: name the pass - the same direction-first cut with the GI method ceiling Off, then with reflections Off.
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Off"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_nogi direction-first cut with GI off: no pale block in the near field
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method SoftwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Off"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_norefl direction-first cut with GI on and reflections off: the block shows whether reflections carry it
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method SoftwareTraced"
Когда run View "View mode: Roughness"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_rough direction-first cut in Roughness: no near-field block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: World Normal"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_normal direction-first cut in World Normal: no near-field block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: Shadow Factor"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_shadow direction-first cut in Shadow Factor: no near-field block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: Ambient Occlusion"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_ao direction-first cut in Ambient Occlusion: no near-field block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: Reflections"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Тогда-вид 1_reflview direction-first cut in Reflections: no near-field block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
